# 🌐 Linguaverse — Hackathon Pitch Walkthrough

> **Multilingual AI-Powered ERP for Indian MSMEs**
> Built for GenAI Hackathon 2026 · Team Linguaverse

---

## 🎯 Problem Statement

**63 million MSMEs** in India still run on paper ledgers and WhatsApp. They lose revenue to:
- **Stock mismatches** — no real-time inventory tracking
- **Unpaid credit (Udhar/Khata)** — ₹67,000+ outstanding with no follow-up system
- **Language barriers** — enterprise software is English-only, but 90% of MSME owners operate in Hindi, Tamil, or regional languages
- **Tech illiteracy** — complex ERP interfaces are unusable for small shop owners

---

## 💡 Our Solution: Linguaverse

A **voice-first, multilingual AI ERP** that any Indian shopkeeper can operate by simply *talking* to it — in Hindi, Hinglish, Tamil, or English.

> **"Relay ka 50 piece aaya"** → AI auto-updates inventory
> **"Sharma ji ne 5000 diya"** → AI records Khata payment
> **"Aaj ka report dikhao"** → AI shows real-time P&L

No forms. No training. Just speak.

---

