## 🛠️ Tech Stack

| Layer | Technology | Why |
|---|---|---|
| **Frontend** | Next.js 14 + React 18 | Server-side rendering, fast HMR |
| **UI Components** | shadcn/ui + TailwindCSS | Premium design system |
| **Charts** | Recharts | Interactive sales trend graphs |
| **Backend** | FastAPI (Python) | Async-ready, auto-generated OpenAPI docs |
| **ORM** | SQLAlchemy 2.0 | Type-safe queries, row locking |
| **Database** | SQLite (local) | Zero-config, portable |
| **AI Engine** | Google Gemini 2.5 Flash | Structured JSON output, multilingual |
| **Voice STT** | Sarvam AI (saaras:v3) | Hindi/Tamil/English speech recognition |
| **Voice TTS** | Sarvam AI (bulbul:v1) | Natural Hindi text-to-speech |

---

## ✨ Feature Walkthrough

### 1. 📊 Dashboard
- **4 live KPI cards**: Today's Sales, Monthly Revenue, Low Stock Alerts, Pending Receivables
- All numbers are **real-time** from the database — not hardcoded
- Click any card → navigates to the relevant tab

### 2. 📦 Inventory (Full CRUD)
- **View**: All products with SKU, price, stock level, and health status badges (Healthy / Warning / Low Stock)
- **Add**: Dialog with Name, SKU, Price, Category, Quantity → `POST /inventory/create`
- **Update**: Stock adjustments via AI agent ("50 relay aaya") → `POST /inventory/update`
- **Delete**: Red delete button per row with confirmation prompt → `DELETE /inventory/{id}`

### 3. 💰 Sales
- **Live feed** of all transactions with product name, quantity, amount, and timestamp
- **Record Sale dialog**: Select product from live inventory dropdown, auto-calculates total
- Sale recording **auto-deducts** inventory using database row locks (`WITH FOR UPDATE`)

### 4. 📒 Khata (Credit Ledger)
- Tracks B2B customers with outstanding balances and overdue days
- Summary cards: Total Outstanding, Active Accounts, Recovered This Week
- **Settle Due dialog**: Record payments → reduces customer balance in real-time

### 5. 🚛 Suppliers & Orders
- Supplier directory with contact info and language preferences
- Purchase orders with status tracking (Pending / Confirmed)
- Expected delivery dates

### 6. 📈 Reports & Analytics
- **Monthly P&L**: Revenue, Expenses, Net Profit (shows red if negative ↓)
- **7-Day Sales Trend**: Interactive line chart (Recharts) with hover tooltips
- **Top Products**: Ranked by revenue with units sold
- **Critical Stock Alerts**: Products below threshold with "Auto-Generate PO" button
- **GST Summary**: Auto-calculated CGST + SGST (18% bracket)

### 7. ⚙️ Settings
- Shop Information (Shop ID, Platform, Backend URL, AI Engine)
- Theme Toggle (Dark/Light mode)
- Language Switcher (EN → HI Partial → HI Full → Tamil → cycle)

