## 🤖 GenAI Integration Deep Dive

### The AI Agent Pipeline

```
User speaks "relay ka 50 piece aaya"
        │
        ▼
   ┌─────────────┐
   │  Sarvam STT │ ← Hindi voice → text
   │  (saaras:v3)│
   └──────┬──────┘
          │ "relay ka 50 piece aaya"
          ▼
   ┌─────────────┐
   │  RAG Context│ ← Fetches live inventory + khata from DB
   │  (rag.py)   │   Capped at 100 products / 50 khata
   └──────┬──────┘
          │ context + user message
          ▼
   ┌─────────────────────┐
   │   Gemini 2.5 Flash  │ ← Structured JSON output
   │   System Prompt:     │   response_schema = AgentResponse
   │   - 9 action types   │   temperature = 0.1
   │   - SKU mapping      │
   │   - Hindi numbers    │
   │   - Confidence score │
   └──────┬──────────────┘
          │ { action: "update_stock", sku: "ELE-OMR-24V", quantity: 50, confidence: 0.95 }
          ▼
   ┌─────────────┐
   │  Frontend   │ ← Shows Confirm/Cancel card
   │  Confirm    │   User clicks Confirm
   └──────┬──────┘
          │
          ▼
   ┌─────────────┐
   │ Backend API │ ← POST /inventory/update
   │ Row Lock    │   quantity += 50 (atomic, race-condition safe)
   │ Commit      │
   └──────┬──────┘
          │
          ▼
   ┌─────────────┐
   │  Sarvam TTS │ ← "Stock updated. New stock: 400 units."
   │  (bulbul:v1)│   Speaks response aloud in Hindi
   └─────────────┘
```

### Supported AI Actions (9 Total)

| Action | Trigger Example | What Happens |
|---|---|---|
| [update_stock](file:///d:/Hackathons/LinguaverseGenAI/linguaverse/backend/tools.py#6-44) | "50 relay aaya" | Adds/removes stock with row locking |
| `add_product` | "naya item Fevikwik add karo" | Creates new product in inventory |
| [record_sale](file:///d:/Hackathons/LinguaverseGenAI/linguaverse/backend/tools.py#45-85) | "10 MCB becha 2450 mein" | Records sale + auto-deducts inventory |
| `khata_payment` | "Sharma ji ne 5000 diya" | Reduces customer outstanding balance |
| `get_stock` | "relay ka stock batao" | Reads and displays current stock |
| [get_khata](file:///d:/Hackathons/LinguaverseGenAI/linguaverse/backend/routes/khata.py#8-28) | "sabka udhar dikhao" | Shows all pending credit accounts |
| [get_report](file:///d:/Hackathons/LinguaverseGenAI/linguaverse/backend/routes/reports.py#10-80) | "aaj ka report" | Shows revenue, profit, top products |
| `clarify` | "kuch karo" | Asks user for more details |
| `unknown` | Unrelated queries | Politely declines |

### Key GenAI Features
- **Structured JSON Output**: Gemini returns a strict Pydantic-validated schema — no free-text parsing needed
- **Multilingual Number Parsing**: "pachaas" → 50, "do hazaar" → 2000
- **Language Matching**: AI replies in the same language the user spoke
- **Confidence Scoring**: 0.95 for exact SKU match, 0.50 for partial, below 0.7 asks for confirmation
- **Prompt Injection Defense**: User input wrapped in `<user_input>` delimiters
- **Retry with Backoff**: 2 retries with 8-second delay for rate limit handling

---

## 🎙️ Voice Integration (Sarvam AI)

- **Press-and-hold mic button** → records audio via MediaRecorder API
- **STT**: Sarvam `saaras:v3` model converts Hindi/Tamil/English speech to text
- **TTS**: Sarvam `bulbul:v1` speaks the AI agent's response aloud
- **Graceful fallbacks**: If mic permission denied → text input still works; if STT fails → shows error message; if TTS fails → text is displayed silently

---

## 🌍 Multilingual Support (5 Language Modes)

| Mode | Label | Coverage |
|---|---|---|
| English | EN | Full UI in English |
| Hindi (Partial) | HI (PARTIAL) | Key labels in Hindi, rest in English |
| Hindi (Full) | HI (FULL) | Complete Hindi interface |
| Tamil | TA | Complete Tamil interface |
| AI Agent | Auto-detect | Replies in whatever language user speaks |

---

## 🔒 Security & Robustness

- [.env](file:///d:/Hackathons/LinguaverseGenAI/linguaverse/backend/.env) files excluded via [.gitignore](file:///d:/Hackathons/LinguaverseGenAI/linguaverse/.gitignore) — API keys never committed
- Database row locking prevents race conditions on concurrent stock updates
- Pydantic schema validation rejects malformed API inputs
- AbortController timeouts (8s) prevent hanging requests
- Centralized error handling with user-friendly error banners

---

